## Reporting a vulnerability

Report privately to **{{ .Values.contact | default "security@example.com" }}**{{ with .Values.pgp }}, encrypted to `{{ . }}` if you'd rather{{ end }}.
Please do not open a public issue for a vulnerability — a public issue is a
disclosure, and it starts the clock before we can do anything about it.

Include what you have: the version, what an attacker gets, and the shortest
path you found to it. A proof of concept helps; a full exploit is not required.

## What happens next

| Step | When |
| ---- | ---- |
| We acknowledge your report | within {{ .Values.ackDays | default 2 }} business days |
| We confirm or dispute the finding | within {{ .Values.triageDays | default 7 }} days |
| We ship a fix for a confirmed issue | within {{ .Values.fixDays | default 90 }} days |
| We publish an advisory{{ with .Values.credit }}, crediting you unless you'd rather we didn't{{ end }} | with the fix |

We will keep you updated while that runs, rather than going quiet.

